NAME=premortem
VERSION=0.1.0
DESCRIPTION=Run a premortem on a plan, launch, product, hire, strategy, partnership, pricing change, or high-cost decision.
TAGS=premortem,risk,strategy,launch,product,decision,blind-spots,stress-test
TRIGGERS=premortem this,premortem my,run a premortem,what could kill this,future-proof this,stress test this plan,what am I missing here,find the blind spots,what could go wrong,poke holes in this,where will this break
INPUTS=plan,audience,success criteria,workspace context
OUTPUTS=premortem report html,premortem transcript,revised plan,pre-launch checklist
